## Source feature-family inventory to complete

This is a map for P124, not an assertion that every listed feature is exercised by an existing automated case. Names come from current native/app.rs and related registrations. Add exact source/selector/cost ownership in the manifest. Optional external hardware/network paths are represented with private prepared sources or marked unobserved; this does not expand physical/provider acceptance beyond the existing scope.

| Shared family | Features/registrations to reconcile | Workflows and directly experienced costs |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Text, icons and controls | Sand, SandText, editable text/input, icons, themes, tokens, sliders, dropdowns, tooltips/toasts, menus | W01/W07/W08/W12/W13; input, resolver reads, text, layout and complete pixels. Shared changed-only password presentation across six native/mobile families is implemented (PASSWORD-MASK-VERIFY); existing Unicode limits, secret accessibility and copy/cut restrictions remain. |
| Workspace/canvas/editing | Canvas, controls, workspaces, edit mode/store, item properties, layout, composition, panels | W06–W13/W25; demand, focus, panel churn, transform versus layout. |
| Record and query presentation | Record views/binding, full Record, Protein Castle/Area, descriptions, record extensions, castle feed | W02–W05/W14/W15; recovery, mutation, fanout, preview and row identity. Local sync provenance/root preparation and collision insertion are implemented (SYNC-LOG-VERIFY); shared Castle and feed/Assertion preparation remain implemented under CASTLE-PRESENTATION-VERIFY and FEED-PRESENTATION-VERIFY. Extension field/feed/reply/inspection, draft sharing, schema validation and receipt encoding have named verification obligations in Overhaul.md. Ordered choice/preset preparation and borrowed Apply/assertion provenance are implemented under EXTENSION-SELECTION-VERIFY and EXTENSION-APPLY-VERIFY. Protein drafts share pure preparation, result pages borrow immutable snapshots, unchanged result/library updates retain controls and status updates retain the table (PROTEIN-DRAFT-VERIFY, PROTEIN-RESULT-VERIFY, PROTEIN-STATUS-VERIFY, PROTEIN-LIBRARY-VERIFY). Whole control-tree rendering is not claimed retained. |
| Assertions/vocabulary/access | Assertion Castle/editor, Ontology, trust, visibility, access control, Organ/context | W14/W15/W26; lookup/validation, membership, access correctness and publication. Ontology lazy catalog order/identity preparation, unchanged reply admission and shared knowledge/history data are implemented under ONTOLOGY-CATALOG-VERIFY and ONTOLOGY-KNOWLEDGE-VERIFY. Organ/Ontology immutable subscription identity and narrowed roster preparation are implemented under CATALOG-SUBSCRIPTION-VERIFY. Visibility reply admission and changed-only access-policy draft preparation are implemented (SCOPED-REPLY-VERIFY/ACCESS-POLICY-VERIFY). Trust shared raw/typed result ownership, borrowed reply preparation, grouped input capture, retained JSON pages and claim-cache byte charges are implemented under the four TRUST-* verification obligations. Queries, fresh authority, provider workers, cancellation and durable actions remain; this does not establish complete access/trust/view coverage. Access-catalogue indexing/paging/source ownership and retained Role choices/permission regions are implemented under ACCESS-CATALOG-VERIFY and ACCESS-ROLE-VERIFY; submitted actions and authority checks remain fresh. |
| Time and planning | Time Castle, work timer, calendar, kanban, todo, frequency, schedule controls | W18/W25; source deadlines, hidden semantic work and unchanged UI. Shared endpoint/metadata validation and one final Timer-request log projection are implemented (WORK-VALIDATION-VERIFY/WORK-PROPERTY-VERIFY). WorkTimer history/duration/order/form preparation is implemented (TIMER-PRESENTATION-VERIFY). Time Castle shares settings and successful source preparation; unchanged subscriptions skip query serialization (CLOCK-PREPARATION-VERIFY). Frequency copies the displayed page, indexes changed results and compares borrowed field text (PLANNING-PRESENTATION-VERIFY). Borrowed typed publication is implemented; JSON-VERIFY retains decoder/error/order checks. Calendar query and picker-parse reuse (PICKER-PREPARATION-VERIFY), Todo shared-row/page ownership and Kanban rank/topology preparation are implemented; FEED-PRESENTATION-VERIFY, TASK-QUEUE-VERIFY and KANBAN-PREPARATION-VERIFY retain their resource and behavior checks. |
| Automation and simulation | Karma, Demeter, simulation, transfer, rules/actions | W15/W18; retained planning presentation, canonical worker admission and Demeter/optimizer preparation are implemented with their named verification obligations. Simulation now captures changed text, shares source parsing/base digests and artifact bundles, narrows Karma import preparation, batches live revision observations and publishes only changed status (SIM-CAPTURE-VERIFY, SIM-SOURCE-VERIFY, SIM-LIVE-VERIFY). Transfer changed-field capture, borrowed snapshot admission, prepared audience policies and lazy form JSON have their four TRANSFER-*-VERIFY obligations. Fresh authority/validation, source isolation, explicit run/save/accept/share, timers and canonical durability remain. |
| Threads and assistants | Thread Castle, Fiote session/character, communication/speech/listening/call paths | W16/W25/W26; shared replies, changed-only controls, prepared command/mention search, visible metadata, shared drafts/validation, retained previews, buffered file publication and avatar preparation/publication are implemented with their named report checks still unrun. Stored-message snapshot/part retention, retained step controls/read-only progress and exact chunk-based transcript publication are also implemented; STORED-MESSAGE-VERIFY, STEP-PRESENTATION-VERIFY, MESSAGE-PROGRESS-VERIFY and TRANSCRIPT-PRESENTATION-VERIFY remain. Streaming/worker/cancellation and wider view-lifecycle coverage remain. Borrowed identity reconciliation and unchanged order retention are implemented under THREAD-ORDER-VERIFY. |
| Local programs | Terminal, Command Castle, saved commands/history | W17; bounded output service and producer notifications. |
| Local files and developer views | File explorer, document viewer, source view, IDE, external drop/openers | W06/W19; read/parse/decode, eager resources, saving and conflict handling. |
| Images/media/capture | Media Sand, video, sound, sound Areas, camera, recorder, capture controls | W20/W22/W24; scoped sound membership and changed-only sound controls are implemented (SOUND-CROSSING-VERIFY, SOUND-CONTROL-VERIFY). Required playback/recording and explicit actions remain. Other producer-demand, shared decode/upload, clock and ownership questions require their own source evidence. |
| Shader/spatial/graphics | Shader Castle/effects, drawing, map/location, topology/splats/rooms/terrain, physics/Areas | W09/W10/W20/W21; changed participants, pipeline readiness, geometry and GPU work. Map request identity/query preparation, live/page ownership and marker application are implemented (MAP-PREPARATION-VERIFY); Shader presentation borrows unchanged configuration/selection (CASTLE-PRESENTATION-VERIFY). Borrowed native/mobile Location and native Map reply admission is implemented (SCOPED-REPLY-VERIFY), with original scope/expiry/source validation and request order. Shared operation-local barriers and narrowed placement preparation are implemented (AREA-BLOCKER-VERIFY), retaining current target decisions and canonical action guards. Retained-memory and complete-path effects remain unmeasured. |
| Sync and maintenance | Sync Castle, information, configuration, backup, notifications, component pushes | W06/W13/W25/W26; subscriptions, polling, status refresh, background I/O and initialization. Notification snapshot/caption sharing and indexed toast matching implemented; NOTIFICATION-PREPARATION-VERIFY pending. Canonical sync/social/evidence/mail worker watches exclude forecast-only refreshes; sync cadence reads one scalar aggregate (CANONICAL-WORKER-WAKE-VERIFY/SYNC-CADENCE-VERIFY). Initial passes, actual general/Fact changes, retries and expiry deadlines remain. |
| Shared-workspace collaboration | nucleus Component references, engine/workspace_sync adapters/layout/review, native/workspace_sync controls/Record labels and replica application | W05/W06/W13/W25/W26; earlier borrowed reference/control preparation and nested-label retention remain under WORKSPACE-VERIFY. Prepared replica reconciliation, shared typed restoration/native precision, unchanged top-level summaries and maintenance ownership are implemented under WORKSPACE-REPLICA-VERIFY, WORKSPACE-GEOMETRY-VERIFY, WORKSPACE-REPLICA-LABEL-VERIFY and WORKSPACE-MAINTENANCE-VERIFY. Current authority, policy invalidation, host action guards, subscriptions, queue-full retries and source isolation remain required. |
| Canvas command state and recovery | nucleus/canvas/state; native/canvas_host; workspace recovery/scratch | W06/W10/W12/W13/W25/W26; shared immutable snapshots/registry/history, page-only inspection and retained receipt charges implemented; CANVAS-STATE-VERIFY covers mutation, undo, recovery, cancellation and ownership. |
| Record read and executable-command preparation | store/records, assertions, communication and transfers; engine/collab, record_extensions, communication, component_presentation, canvas and message Actions | W02/W04/W06/W08/W13/W15/W25/W26; narrow reads, active-side relation membership/IDs/kinds, Transfer presence, thread-title sets, staged references and owned dispatch implemented; RECORD-READ-VERIFY, COMPONENT-PREPARE-VERIFY and CANVAS-COMMAND-VERIFY preserve fresh authority, ordering, validation, replies and durability. |
| Workspace recovery and save admission | native/workspace and workspace/storage | W06/W10/W12/W13/W25; reserve pending-save capacity before full recovery capture, retain only uncaptured Record snapshots; WORKSPACE-STORAGE-VERIFY covers backpressure, flush, failure, shutdown, exact recovery and complete cost. |
| Atomic work metadata and property projection | engine/record_change and private_work | W02/W04/W15/W18/W25; one prepared old-log index and final projection per atomic metadata request, one slug-register write; P120/WORK-PROPERTY-VERIFY preserves accepted ranks, ordered history/sync, final validation, rollback and acknowledgement. |
| Canvas selection, groups and item controls | native/canvas_selection, canvas_item and sand_placement | W07/W09/W10/W11/W25; canonical selection retention, borrowed membership, shared menu preparation, reused query/scratch state and sparse group expansion are implemented. CANVAS-SELECTION-VERIFY/CANVAS-GROUP-VERIFY cover current eligibility/geometry, exact selection/group/action behavior, retained overlays, interruption and complete frame/memory cost. |
| Native canvas projection and application | native/canvas_host/snapshot, metadata, apply, factories and authoring | W06/W10/W12/W13/W25/W26; direct metadata capture, one text/selection preparation, owned JSON strings, borrowed decoding, live changed-only values and workspace-state ownership implemented; CANVAS-PROJECTION-VERIFY covers exact state, lifecycle, authority, recovery and resource cost. |
| Native component schema and fallback preparation | native/canvas_host, custom_castle and sand_placement; nucleus/canvas/state; engine/canvas | W06/W10/W12/W13/W25/W26; current-timezone/language descriptor sharing and lazy factory fallbacks implemented; CANVAS-REGISTRY-VERIFY covers defaults, refresh, isolation, validation and restored state. |
| JSON admission and evidence budgets | nucleus/json; core/backend/store/transport/Fiote/interface consumers; execution/control | Size-only serialization and retained schedule charges implemented; JSON-VERIFY and SCHEDULE-BUDGET-VERIFY cover exact admission, identity, failures and evidence retention. Question schema counting and borrowed assistant fingerprints use the same consumers. Buffered JSON file publication and no-change resource-reference admission are implemented under JSON-FILE-VERIFY; required wire/storage payload encoding remains. |
| Shortcut configuration and input matching | native/shortcuts, shortcuts/model/prepared and desktop pointer manipulation | W01/W09/W11/W13/W23/W28; immutable syntax/static binding preparation and borrowed current matching implemented. SHORTCUT-SNAPSHOT-VERIFY/SHORTCUT-DISPATCH-VERIFY cover mutation/schema/error semantics, host/modal/focus/modifier routing, first-use preparation and full input/resource cost. |
| Canvas toolbar and reveal controls | native/canvas_controls, canvas_controls/ordering and canvas_controls/corner | W09/W10/W11/W13/W25; borrowed hierarchy/order checks, changed-only normalization, shared fresh owner/focus/theme preparation and orphan-corner retirement implemented. TOOLBAR-ORDER-VERIFY/TOOLBAR-CORNER-VERIFY cover stable priorities, tooltips, focus/scroll, deadlines, owner lifecycle and full frame/resource cost. |
| Inspection input and overlays | native/inspection, inspection/preparation and inspection/drawing | W09/W10/W13/W23/W28; changed-only state, shared current tree/bounds preparation, borrowed connection names, bounded previews and retained primitives implemented. INSPECTION-INPUT-VERIFY/INSPECTION-SCENE-VERIFY/INSPECTION-OVERLAY-VERIFY cover exact state/mark recipe, source isolation, geometry, layering/glyphs, lifecycle and full frame/resource cost. |
| Learning/testing/navigation | Instinct/practice/tutorial, Laboratory, shortcuts, accessibility, inspection/credits | W01/W13/W23/W28; isolated state, result wiring, focus, export and lazy resources. Immutable shortcut preparation and borrowed matching remain implemented (SHORTCUT-SNAPSHOT-VERIFY/SHORTCUT-DISPATCH-VERIFY). Ordered conflict caching and retained editor rows are implemented under SHORTCUT-CONFLICT-VERIFY/SHORTCUT-PRESENTATION-VERIFY. Typed configuration-review snapshots and retained publication are implemented under CONFIG-REVIEW-SNAPSHOT-VERIFY/CONFIG-REVIEW-LIFECYCLE-VERIFY; SETTINGS-TEXT-VERIFY covers the shared borrowed-label path. Shared per-event held keys, changed-only logical modifiers and reusable ordered input batches are implemented under KEYBOARD-SNAPSHOT-VERIFY/KEYBOARD-BATCH-VERIFY; event order, fresh host/focus/layout state and quarantine remain required. Narrowed manipulation batches, indexed pointer reconciliation and inactive shortcut capture are implemented under POINTER-BATCH-VERIFY/POINTER-REPLAY-VERIFY/POINTER-CAPTURE-VERIFY. |
| Desktop settings | Overview, gestures, focus policy, width/height presets, keyboard settings, opening rules, external commands, touch/tablet settings | SETTINGS-FIELD-VERIFY, OVERVIEW-GESTURE-VERIFY, WIDTH-DRAFT-VERIFY, WIDTH-SUMMARY-VERIFY and KEYBOARD-SETTINGS-VERIFY cover retained field/view work. SETTINGS-CONTROLS-VERIFY/FOCUS-SETTINGS-VERIFY cover changed-only publication and live policy/status. OPENING-RULE-LIST-VERIFY/OPENING-WINDOW-VERIFY/OPENING-VALIDITY-VERIFY and OPENING-EDITOR-DRAFT-VERIFY/OPENING-EDITOR-OWNER-VERIFY/OPENING-EDITOR-PRESENTATION-VERIFY/OPENING-REFERENCE-VERIFY cover opening rules, editors and reference lifetime. EXTERNAL-DRAFT-VERIFY/EXTERNAL-SETTINGS-VERIFY and ABSOLUTE-DRAFT-VERIFY/ABSOLUTE-PRESENTATION-VERIFY cover retained command/device preparation with live host/request authority. Retain tiny/cold/all-changing cost and memory checks. |
| Desktop focus and dialog placement | native/layout/desktop/focus, focus/memory/restoration and transients/placement | W07/W08/W09/W10/W11/W24/W25; identity-first target lookup, selective saved-focus restoration and requested-ID dialog placement are implemented. FOCUS-TARGET-VERIFY/FOCUS-RESTORATION-VERIFY/TRANSIENT-PLACEMENT-VERIFY cover native/input ownership, deferred retry, first-match/duplicate semantics, original ordered placement and shared normal/preview/transfer behavior; no cross-call target cache or skipped model authoring. |
| Desktop lifecycle and structural checks | native/layout/desktop root scope, preferences, transients/inheritance; shared layout/desktop and rows/validation | W07/W08/W09/W10/W11/W24/W25; root-scoped phase reads, narrow current opening values, indexed restored owners and fresh shared validation facts are implemented. DESKTOP-SCOPE-VERIFY/DESKTOP-PREFERENCES-VERIFY/DESKTOP-INHERITANCE-VERIFY/DESKTOP-VALIDATION-VERIFY cover canonical hierarchy, current ownership, repeated identities, original validation predicates and complete update/resource cost. |
| Desktop resolution and geometry publication | native/layout/desktop, publication, viewport, focus; shared layout/desktop solver | W07/W08/W09/W10/W11/W24/W25; current-phase row/source preparation, retained membership/stamps, inline compact clips, changed-row geometry publication, offset-only reads and mode-specific solver views are implemented. DESKTOP-GEOMETRY-VERIFY/DESKTOP-RESOLVE-VERIFY/DESKTOP-SOLVER-PREPARE-VERIFY cover exact mappings/revisions/order, focus/clip behavior, lifecycle, all layout modes and whole-frame/resource cost. |
| Park/native/client integration | External windows, output/layer-shell controls, launcher, clipboard/drop, capture/lock | W06/W08/W11/W22/W24/W27; independent routing/presentation, lifetime and security epochs. |
| Feature-gated compiled additions | Every extra native/app registration enabled by the actual shipping features, including games where present | Map to existing interaction/media/worker families and a representative start/focus/exit workflow; do not enable optional features solely to inflate the test set. |

Registration alone does not imply a system runs, allocates eagerly or wastes time. For every family, distinguish no instances, visible instances, off-camera instances, inactive workspace, no consumers, active semantic jobs, pending dirty edits and multiple consumers. Record which conditions are applicable rather than pretending every feature supports all of them.
